# LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows' `core.autocrlf=true` checks every file out with CRLF
# while biome.json pins `"lineEnding": "lf"`, so the formatter and the checkout
# disagree by construction: `pnpm lint` came back with 27 line-ending errors
# immediately after a merge, on files nobody had touched. Two settings that must
# agree and cannot fail together.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect binaries and leave them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
